<title>SLOVAKIA: Slovak Nafta posts SKK 335.6 mln 9month net profit.</title>
<headline>Slovak Nafta posts SKK 335.6 mln 9month net profit.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for nine-month period ending September 30, 1996 (in million crowns).  After-tax profit		 335.554	  624.016</p>
<p> Operating revenues	   2,867.378	2,701.508</p>
<p> Operating costs		2,164.864	1,780.838</p>
<p> Operating profit		 702.514	  920.670</p>
<p>Profit from regular   activities			336.254	  625.848</p>
<p>Revenues from   financial operations	  269.817	    47.143</p>
<p> Financial costs		  309.651	    21.205</p>
<p>Results from   financial operations	  -39.834	  +25.938</p>
<p> Total loans			582.004	  601.655</p>
<p> Long-term operating loans     21.563	   28.750</p>
<p> Long-term investment loans   560.441	  572.905</p>
<p> Basic capital		  3,230.960	3,230.960</p>
<p> Total assets		   7,115.459	6,799.960</p>
<p>Note: Full company name is Nafta a.s. Gbely. The company has a dominant position on the Slovak natural gas and oil exploration markets as well as underground gas storage. Results are provided by the Bratislava Stock Exchange</p>
<p>-- Bratislava Newsroom, 42-7-563-3688</p>
</text>
